#
# Cross-check: ../oracle/cbor2_check.py decodes each file with Python
# cbor2 6.3.0 (https://pypi.org/project/cbor2/) and requires that
# cbor2.dumps(value, canonical=True) gives the same bytes, i.e. that each
# fixture is in RFC 8949 §4.2.1 core deterministic encoding.
# ../oracle/cbor2_check.out is its unmodified output, every file "ok".
# Regenerate: python3 -I ../oracle/cbor2_check.py > ../oracle/cbor2_check.out
# with an interpreter that has cbor2 (here a venv outside the repository).
#
# provider-hello-retention.hex was added on 2026-11-21 the same way, by
