#
# send-silent.hex likewise, from Send's silent (bead mimid-e64f.20).
#
# error-rate-limited.hex likewise, from Error's retryAfter (bead mimid-e64f.21).
#
# ack-list-clients.hex and provider-hello-max-clients.hex likewise, from
# ListClients and maxClients (bead mimid-e64f.22).
#
# provider-hello-max-kp-lifetime.hex likewise, from maxKeyPackageLifetime
